    "body": "@foolip, the \"triggered by a user generated orientation change\" was underspecified and only implemented in Chrome. We are trying to address this issue in an interoperable manner in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8490 \r\n\r\nHowever, Screen Orientation no longer defines \"triggered by a user generated orientation change\" so that  doesn't make sense anymore in the FS spec (i.e., it doesn't link to anything anymore).",
